@startuml BrewLite Checkout Use Case
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle stickman
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F4F7F5
  BorderColor #315B4A
  ArrowColor #52685D
}
title BrewLite - Use Case chi tiet: Dat hang va thanh toan (VNPay Sandbox)

actor "Khach hang\n(CUSTOMER)" as Customer
actor "VNPay Sandbox\n(signed IPN)" as Provider

rectangle "BrewLite Web + API" {
  usecase "Dat hang tu gio\n(POST /orders)" as PlaceOrder
  usecase "Xem truoc ma khuyen mai" as PreviewPromotion
  usecase "Xac thuc JWT, tai ho so\nva so du diem" as AuthProfile
  usecase "Kiem tra gio, san pham,\nsize va topping" as ValidateCart
  usecase "Tinh gia va xac nhan\nkhuyen mai phia server" as CalculateAmount
  usecase "Kiem tra va tru ton\nnguyen lieu trong transaction" as CheckStock
  usecase "Tao Order / OrderItem\n(status = PENDING)" as SavePending
  usecase "Tao phien VNPay Sandbox\n(POST /payments, PENDING)" as StartPayment
  usecase "Xac minh chu don, so tien,\ndiem va Idempotency-Key" as VerifyPayment
  usecase "Tiep nhan IPN\n(GET /payments/webhooks/vnpay)" as ReceiveIPN
  usecase "Xac minh chu ky, merchant,\nma giao dich va so tien" as VerifyIPN
  usecase "Chot Payment va cap nhat\ntrang thai Order" as RecordResult
  usecase "Thu lai PAYMENT_FAILED\n(tao Idempotency-Key moi)" as RetryPayment
  usecase "Thanh cong: Payment SUCCESS, Order PAID;\ntru diem neu dung, cong diem mot lan;\nxoa dong gio da mua, xem xac nhan" as PaymentSuccess
  usecase "That bai: Payment FAILED, Order PAYMENT_FAILED;\ngiu gio va cho phep thu lai" as PaymentFailure
  usecase "Xem trang thai va lich su don\n(GET /orders/me)" as ViewOrders
  usecase "Huy don dang cho / loi\n(POST /orders/:id/cancel)" as CancelOrder
}

Customer --> PlaceOrder
Customer --> StartPayment
Customer --> RetryPayment
Customer --> ViewOrders
Customer --> CancelOrder
Provider --> ReceiveIPN

PlaceOrder .> AuthProfile : <<include>>
PlaceOrder .> ValidateCart : <<include>>
PlaceOrder .> CalculateAmount : <<include>>
PlaceOrder .> CheckStock : <<include>>
PlaceOrder .> SavePending : <<include>>
PreviewPromotion .> PlaceOrder : <<extend>> [co ma khuyen mai]

StartPayment .> VerifyPayment : <<include>>
RetryPayment .> StartPayment : <<extend>> [don PAYMENT_FAILED]
ReceiveIPN .> VerifyIPN : <<include>>
ReceiveIPN .> RecordResult : <<include>> [IPN hop le]
PaymentSuccess .> RecordResult : <<extend>> [IPN thanh cong]
PaymentFailure .> RecordResult : <<extend>> [IPN that bai]

note right of ReceiveIPN
POST /payments chi tao payment PENDING va checkoutUrl.
Chi signed IPN hop le moi duoc chot trang thai.
Browser return khong chung minh da thanh toan.
IPN sai chu ky/so tien bi tu choi, khong chot don.
end note

note bottom of CheckStock
Ton nguyen lieu tru khi tao don trong transaction.
Payment FAILED khong tu dong hoan ton.
Huy don hop le hoac phien PENDING het han co the
huy don va hoan ton qua transaction.
end note

note bottom of RetryPayment
Chi thu lai khi nguoi dung chu dong yeu cau,
su dung key moi tren cung don PAYMENT_FAILED.
end note
@enduml
